{'symbol': 'NOC', 'date': '2023-05-16 16:30:00', 'title': 'NORTHROP GRUMMAN INCREASES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND 8 PERCENT TO $1.87', 'text': 'FALLS CHURCH, VA., MAY 16, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF NORTHROP GRUMMAN CORPORATION (NYSE: NOC) DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $1.87 PER SHARE ON NORTHROP GRUMMAN COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE JUNE 14, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS MAY 30, 2023.'}